Subject: [PATCH 7/8] lamport landing edit LE-facade: alphabetical order of the
 helper imports

Seyoon's 2026-11-14 ruling approves exactly sixteen Lamport helper imports in the frozen
`TCSlib/Cryptography/Authentication.lean` facade. This edit only reorders those sixteen lines.
They stay directly after `Signatures.Lamport`, now in alphabetical order. That is the same form
as the dl-crh LE-facade in `Hashing.lean` and the hash-sign LE-facade for the `HashAndSign`
helpers. No import is added or removed, and nothing else changes.

